{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 54, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel did according to all that</b> etc. And where was Aaron? Rabbi Yehoshua ben Nechemiah said in the name of Rabbi Chiya: to register them by genealogy. They said: until you come to register us — register Pinchas son of Elazar: his son, whom was Elazar married to? Was it not to the daughter of Putiel, as it is written ״ואלעזר לקח לו מבנות פוטיאל״ etc.? Once HaKadosh Baruch Hu saw that they were treating him dismissively, He came and registered him: ״פנחס בן אלעזר בן אהרן הכהן״ — a priest son of a priest, a zealot son of a zealot. Another interpretation: according to its plain sense, <b>and the children of Israel did</b> — they never touched the Tabernacle."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "הקב״ה expanded per the voice rule that reverent abbreviations resolve mechanically; HaKadosh Baruch Hu is the standard expansion of this abbreviation."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:16.670788368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}